    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 138.8,
      "end_time": 139.12
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm an early riser as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 139.12,
      "end_time": 140.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Just didn't want to wake my wife up in the shower and all that, so just tossed on a hat and let's do it.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 140.72,
      "end_time": 148.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Perfect.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 148.96,
      "end_time": 149.44
    },
    {
      "text": "So I think where we left off before, you were just kind of explaining to me the secret sauce on the bidding, which I get, and the data that you're capturing on the lost bids and migrating that over to less expensive platforms.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 149.92,
      "end_time": 162.69
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 162.93,
      "end_time": 163.41
    },
    {
      "text": "Which.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 163.89,
      "end_time": 164.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Which makes a tremendous amount of sense.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 164.25,
      "end_time": 166.05
    },
    {
      "text": "Just kind of anticipating questions.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 167.49,
      "end_time": 169.13
    },
    {
      "text": "I think the people I'd like to introduce this to are going to ask is, you know, the first one's going to be, why now?",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 169.13,
      "end_time": 175.41
    },
    {
      "text": "It looks like it's scaling nicely.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 175.41,
      "end_time": 176.97
    },
    {
      "text": "It's very profitable.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 176.97,
      "end_time": 177.89
    },
    {
      "text": "And I think we discussed it a little bit in terms of you just not wanting to be involved in back office and running the operational side of it necessarily as the business scales and focus on sales.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 177.89,
      "end_time": 188.75
    },
    {
      "text": "And I just want to make sure that my understanding is correct so that I can position that properly.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 188.75,
      "end_time": 194.11
    },
    {
      "text": "And then just really trying to get an understanding of what you're looking for in terms of structure and how you guys are valuing the business today.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 194.75,
      "end_time": 202.63
    },
    {
      "text": "Those things.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 202.63,
      "end_time": 203.23
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 204.27,
      "end_time": 206.11
    },
    {
      "text": "So for the first part, that's, that's, that, that, that sounds right.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 206.11,
      "end_time": 211.23
    },
    {
      "text": "Like just like the general structure is like I would, I'm looking to sell a majority of the company to, to a company that can help me scale.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 214.76,
      "end_time": 223.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 223.8,
      "end_time": 224.36
    },
    {
      "text": "So scale can really come in multiple ways.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 224.36,
      "end_time": 228.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 228.92,
      "end_time": 229.32
    },
    {
      "text": "And getting through multiple kind of forms.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 229.32,
      "end_time": 231.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Hopefully, you know, the more boxes we check, the tighter of a partner it becomes.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 231.28,
      "end_time": 235.16
    },
    {
      "text": "One is like all of this back office stuff that you mentioned, you know, finance and you know, accounting and legal and account management, these types of things that really consume more time than they should.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 235.4,
      "end_time": 247.51
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 248.23,
      "end_time": 248.79
    },
    {
      "text": "Second is through clients, like if they have clients that are incremental or.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 248.87,
      "end_time": 254.79
    },
    {
      "text": "You.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 256.79,
      "end_time": 257.07
    },
    {
      "text": "Know, spending, that's, that's good, you know, just more demand.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 257.07,
      "end_time": 260.43
    },
    {
      "text": "They can introduce me to demand.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 260.43,
      "end_time": 261.75
    },
    {
      "text": "And then the third is supply.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 261.75,
      "end_time": 264.79
    },
    {
      "text": "Like if they have data, if they have unique data sets, if they have unique audiences that we can plug into the existing clients that I have, that's just also incremental revenue.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 264.95,
      "end_time": 272.96
    },
    {
      "text": "So really those are the three key vectors.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 273.36,
      "end_time": 275.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 275.72,
      "end_time": 276.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Supply, demand, and then kind of administration, back office stuff.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 276.04,
      "end_time": 280.36
    },
    {
      "text": "And if I was to add a fourth one, it would be.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 280.36,
      "end_time": 282.08
    },
    {
      "text": "If they have like product management experience and can develop like a customer facing platform or have experience doing that.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 286.48,
      "end_time": 292.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I think that would be a kind of like extra, extra credit.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 292.44,
      "end_time": 295.36
    },
    {
      "text": "And so how I think about the valuation of the business is from like if you look at the valuation of other.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 295.68,
      "end_time": 303.3
    },
    {
      "text": "We don't consider ourselves an agency really like a media buying agency because we don't actually do any, any media buying.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 303.86,
      "end_time": 309.66
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 309.66,
      "end_time": 310.02
    },
    {
      "text": "We share audiences.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 311.38,
      "end_time": 312.38
    },
    {
      "text": "They do the media buying against the audience.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 312.38,
      "end_time": 313.94
    },
    {
      "text": "We're more of like a data as a service company.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 313.94,
      "end_time": 315.86
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 316.82,
      "end_time": 317.38
    },
    {
      "text": "And so given that the, the data that we produce is actually an appreciating asset over time and we have significant ip, we're only like the valuation we've placed on the business is only a 4x, which is a very conservative multiple.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 317.78,
      "end_time": 338.67
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 338.83,
      "end_time": 339.23
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, we did 2.3 million in the past 12 months.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 340.75,
      "end_time": 345.23
    },
    {
      "text": "So 4x, I would put it between 8, 8 and 9 million.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 346.51,
      "end_time": 349.63
    },
    {
      "text": "So what I'm looking to do is sell, you know, between 70 and 80% of it could be between 60 and 80, you know, some, some majority stake.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 350.37,
      "end_time": 358.93
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's just say it's 75%.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 358.93,
      "end_time": 360.37
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 361.01,
      "end_time": 361.65
    },
    {
      "text": "I would retain 25%, 20%, 15%, whatever the number is, and basically just focus exclusively on, on sales.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 363.65,
      "end_time": 372.21
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 373.33,
      "end_time": 373.73
    },
    {
      "text": "You guys would, whoever the acquiring entity in is would book all the revenue for themselves as well as it's making half a million a month.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 373.81,
      "end_time": 380.9
    },
    {
      "text": "They're going to book that half a million as their revenue and pay me out the percentage as an expense to me.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 380.98,
      "end_time": 386.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 386.34,
      "end_time": 386.74
    },
    {
      "text": "So they would be the full acquirers of the revenue and I would be paid out like a contractor or an employee or a partner would be.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 387.7,
      "end_time": 396.66
    },
    {
      "text": "But my would exclusively then focus on scaling the revenue through sales and my relationships and kind of doing what I do, what I do best.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 397.14,
      "end_time": 403.86
    },
    {
      "text": "Lost the audio there for a second, sorry, not sure what I'm saying.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 404.74,
      "end_time": 409.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, how about now?",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 412.95,
      "end_time": 414.07
    },
    {
      "text": "No, no, I can't.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 414.15,
      "end_time": 415.31
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 415.31,
      "end_time": 415.71
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, cool.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 415.71,
      "end_time": 416.43
    },
    {
      "text": "I was saying, yeah, I would like.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 416.43,
      "end_time": 417.63
    },
    {
      "text": "To.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 417.63,
      "end_time": 417.91
    },
    {
      "text": "Sell a majority of the company to them so they can, you know, and they would book the revenue, like let's say I'm making half a million a month, they would book that as revenue for themselves and pay me out as a partner, an employee or, or a contractor of my, my share.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 419.75,
      "end_time": 434.47
    },
    {
      "text": "Right?",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 434.47,
      "end_time": 434.79
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 434.79,
      "end_time": 435.11
    },
    {
      "text": "There'd be a three year employment agreement for sure.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 435.11,
      "end_time": 437.51
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 437.67,
      "end_time": 438.07
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 438.23,
      "end_time": 438.63
    },
    {
      "text": "Or maybe probably longer.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 439.51,
      "end_time": 440.83
    },
    {
      "text": "I would like to stay in the business for, for as long as possible.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 440.83,
      "end_time": 443.83
    },
    {
      "text": "Right, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 443.99,
      "end_time": 444.95
    },
    {
      "text": "That keeps me tied and that.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 445.27,
      "end_time": 446.79
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, I have a lot of energy, I have a lot of great clients, I have a lot of great ideas.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 447.99,
      "end_time": 451.83
    },
    {
      "text": "And so the more I think whoever acquires me will probably, you know, potentially want me in for longer.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 452.15,
      "end_time": 458.59
    },
    {
      "text": "But yeah, something like three years.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 458.59,
      "end_time": 460.07
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, probably three years is kind of a minimum.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 460.23,
      "end_time": 462.59
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 462.59,
      "end_time": 462.95
    },
    {
      "text": "So I mean, the goal, I think is to, to let you run and build this business.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 462.95,
      "end_time": 467.89
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, Prizeout would be a good partner because you'd have some help on the product development side.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 467.97,
      "end_time": 472.77
    },
    {
      "text": "A large customer base, a good data set, things like that.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 472.77,
      "end_time": 476.09
    },
    {
      "text": "That could be very useful to you.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 476.09,
      "end_time": 478.21
    },
    {
      "text": "Yobi, probably a better data set.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 478.21,
      "end_time": 484.21
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I won't say probably.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 484.77,
      "end_time": 486.61
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll just say it's going to be a significantly better data set.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 486.61,
      "end_time": 489.81
    },
    {
      "text": "But, you know, a very, very focused development team, a very, very focused strategy.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 492.24,
      "end_time": 499.12
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm not sure from their perspective how it fits in, but those would be the two entities that I'd start with.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 499.12,
      "end_time": 506
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 506.4,
      "end_time": 506.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Because those are the two that I see the best alignment with you.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 506.84,
      "end_time": 510.72
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, Prize out has a very good investment stable.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 512.56,
      "end_time": 517.48
    },
    {
      "text": "A lot of, you know, Mark Cuban's in there, my family office that I work for is in there and some gaming, a gaming VC fund is in there as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 517.48,
      "end_time": 525.73
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 526.45,
      "end_time": 526.85
    },
    {
      "text": "And Then obviously the credit.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 527.57,
      "end_time": 528.93
    },
    {
      "text": "The credit unions themselves.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 528.93,
      "end_time": 530.21
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 530.37,
      "end_time": 530.85
    },
    {
      "text": "So a very, very good investor set in there.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 531.17,
      "end_time": 534.89
    },
    {
      "text": "And as I mentioned to you, we have a very large.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 534.89,
      "end_time": 536.53
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 538.29,
      "end_time": 538.65
    },
    {
      "text": "And client set like those are.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 538.65,
      "end_time": 539.85
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, absolutely.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 539.85,
      "end_time": 540.85
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, we have clients.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 540.85,
      "end_time": 541.97
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 542.29,
      "end_time": 542.77
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, like I said, BGW is a client.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 542.85,
      "end_time": 545.17
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 545.17,
      "end_time": 545.89
    },
    {
      "text": "A ton of credit unions, a lot of other papaya, a lot of other gaming companies.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 546.05,
      "end_time": 551.37
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, we used to deal with some European gaming companies, but Europe's just.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 552.33,
      "end_time": 559.29
    },
    {
      "text": "It's not a focus for us right now.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 559.69,
      "end_time": 561.65
    },
    {
      "text": "So we ended up getting rid of that gaming relationship.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 561.65,
      "end_time": 565.01
    },
    {
      "text": "But we have several others here domestically, that and vgw of course.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 565.01,
      "end_time": 568.69
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 568.69,
      "end_time": 569.05
    },
    {
      "text": "So that's.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 569.13,
      "end_time": 569.69
    },
    {
      "text": "That's perfect.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 569.69,
      "end_time": 570.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Very strong I mentioned, but yeah, I know exactly they.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 570.25,
      "end_time": 573.29
    },
    {
      "text": "Right, yeah, yeah, exactly.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 573.67,
      "end_time": 576.19
    },
    {
      "text": "You're saying all the names.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 576.19,
      "end_time": 577.23
    },
    {
      "text": "You're saying all the right things.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 577.23,
      "end_time": 578.23
    },
    {
      "text": "All these names are in the exact space I'm in.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 578.23,
      "end_time": 581.15
    },
    {
      "text": "So this is perfect.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 581.15,
      "end_time": 581.99
    },
    {
      "text": "Right in your wheelhouse.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 582.71,
      "end_time": 583.87
    },
    {
      "text": "Now Joby is really Microsoft Azure.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 583.87,
      "end_time": 587.43
    },
    {
      "text": "Very large customer base is the Wolverines, the Coca Cola's of the world.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 588.47,
      "end_time": 593.99
    },
    {
      "text": "Very, very large significant brands that we're working with.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 593.99,
      "end_time": 597.43
    },
    {
      "text": "Their Circle K, you know, just a bunch of things.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 597.59,
      "end_time": 603.18
    },
    {
      "text": "So very, very large data set.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 603.18,
      "end_time": 605.7
    },
    {
      "text": "But again, I'm just not sure the CEO, it's got a very focused agenda.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 606.82,
      "end_time": 613.34
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 613.34,
      "end_time": 613.74
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, I think they'll take a look at it.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 613.74,
      "end_time": 615.62
    },
    {
      "text": "So what I would suggest is that.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 615.7,
      "end_time": 618.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me socialize it with David Metz, who's the CEO over at Prizeout.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 619.78,
      "end_time": 624.18
    },
    {
      "text": "And just so you know, those guys all came out of fanatics or Fanduel or one of.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 624.5,
      "end_time": 629.63
    },
    {
      "text": "Not fanatics, but Fanduel or one of those gaming companies.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 629.63,
      "end_time": 633.23
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 633.47,
      "end_time": 633.87
    },
    {
      "text": "Very successful there.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 634.75,
      "end_time": 635.95
    },
    {
      "text": "So I'll socialize with him and then with.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 636.11,
      "end_time": 639.55
    },
    {
      "text": "With Max Snow over at Yobai.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 639.55,
      "end_time": 642.349
    },
    {
      "text": "So they're both based in New York, but doesn't matter.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 642.91,
      "end_time": 646.99
    },
    {
      "text": "Is there anything I can send you or provide you that would help in that conversation?",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 647.39,
      "end_time": 651.31
    },
    {
      "text": "Like the one pager?",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 651.31,
      "end_time": 653.86
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, what I'm going to do is kind of summarize.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 653.86,
      "end_time": 655.66
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, exactly.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 655.66,
      "end_time": 656.7
    },
    {
      "text": "A one pager from you would be very helpful.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 656.7,
      "end_time": 659.18
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm not going to share the deck.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 659.34,
      "end_time": 660.7
    },
    {
      "text": "I just need some talking points.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 660.7,
      "end_time": 662.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Basically how you would look at it.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 664.22,
      "end_time": 665.94
    },
    {
      "text": "I encourage you to kind of go to, if you haven't already, go to Yobi's website, Prizeout's website.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 665.94,
      "end_time": 670.94
    },
    {
      "text": "Kind of understand, you know, here's how they're kind of attacking the market.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 671.02,
      "end_time": 674.78
    },
    {
      "text": "Not that they necessarily keep their websites up to date either with what's really going on.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 675.18,
      "end_time": 679.34
    },
    {
      "text": "So it might be a bit dated, but you'll get a general idea of the.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 679.34,
      "end_time": 682.85
    },
    {
      "text": "What both of those businesses are in, so.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 683,
      "end_time": 685.16
    },
    {
      "text": "And as I mentioned to you before, a stretch would be 10 cent, right?",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 685.16,
      "end_time": 689.08
    },
    {
      "text": "10 cent.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 689.08,
      "end_time": 689.48
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, I think you guys have great technology and if they could find a way to roll that out to their gaming platform, that would be interesting.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 689.48,
      "end_time": 697.64
    },
    {
      "text": "It's just the size issue, right.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 697.64,
      "end_time": 699.2
    },
    {
      "text": "They're so big that the targets they're typically looking for from an acquisition perspective are fairly sizable.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 699.2,
      "end_time": 704.56
    },
    {
      "text": "But again, I have a good friend who's over down by you and Irvine on their acquisition side, so he would be somebody I'd be happy to.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 704.56,
      "end_time": 714.4
    },
    {
      "text": "To make an introduction to as well, so.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 714.56,
      "end_time": 717.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Great.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 717.92,
      "end_time": 718.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I would love that.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 718.4,
      "end_time": 719.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Perfect.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 720.56,
      "end_time": 721.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 721.2,
      "end_time": 721.72
    },
    {
      "text": "So let's do that.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 721.72,
      "end_time": 722.64
    },
    {
      "text": "While you're flying to Morocco sometime today, you can put together some talking points for me and I'll talk with David and.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 723.36,
      "end_time": 730.88
    },
    {
      "text": "And Max and see what the feedback is and then go from there.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 730.96,
      "end_time": 735.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Amazing, man.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 736.58,
      "end_time": 737.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you very much.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 737.22,
      "end_time": 738.18
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for waking up and talking to me this early.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 738.18,
      "end_time": 740.46
    },
    {
      "text": "I will.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 740.46,
      "end_time": 740.98
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll send those talking points over to you.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 740.98,
      "end_time": 742.82
    },
    {
      "text": "No, thank you.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 743.06,
      "end_time": 743.7
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sure I probably.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 743.7,
      "end_time": 744.46
    },
    {
      "text": "I probably got you out of bed the other way around.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 744.46,
      "end_time": 747.46
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm used to it like you.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 748.1,
      "end_time": 749.22
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 749.22,
      "end_time": 749.62
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I'll send this over the next couple hours.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 749.78,
      "end_time": 751.46
    },
    {
      "text": "Here, you should have that in your inbox.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 751.46,
      "end_time": 752.9
    },
    {
      "text": "Perfect.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 754.1,
      "end_time": 754.54
    },
    {
      "text": "Amir, thanks so much.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 754.54,
      "end_time": 755.54
    },
    {
      "text": "Ahmed, thanks so much.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 755.54,
      "end_time": 756.66
    },
    {
      "text": "And safe travels today.",
      "speaker_name": "Tyler Tarr",
      "start_time": 756.82,
      "end_time": 758.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you so much.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 759.14,
      "end_time": 759.9
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you so much, Tyler, take care, man.",
      "speaker_name": "Ameer Hashish",
      "start_time": 759.9,
      "end_time": 761.62
    }
